sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Requesting developer
  participant UI as Connections UI/service
  participant API as Express
  participant C as connectionController
  participant DB as MongoDB
  participant N as Notification + Socket.IO
  A->>UI: send connection request
  UI->>API: POST /api/connections/request/:userId
  API->>C: protect + request rate limit
  C->>DB: check existing request / create pending Connection
  C->>N: notify recipient
  N->>DB: persist Notification
  N-->>N: emit realtime event if socket available
  A-->>UI: request result
  A->>API: recipient accepts or rejects
  API->>DB: update Connection status
  API->>N: create acceptance notification when appropriate
